This package is a vendored copy of the low-level ACME protocol client from
github.com/mholt/acmez/v3 (the v3/acme subpackage), plus the TLSALPN01ChallengeCert
helper from the top-level package, as of acmez v3.1.6.

Original work Copyright 2020 Matthew Holt, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

It was vendored into gibcert so the ACME order flow can be extended with fields
and lifecycle behavior the upstream package does not expose (e.g. STAR / RFC 8739
auto-renewal, and future newOrder extensions), which is not possible from an
external package because request signing is unexported. The high-level porcelain
(Solver / ObtainCertificate / CSR helpers) was intentionally not vendored; gibcert
drives the protocol directly from internal/acmeclient.

Local modifications:
  - tlsalpn01.go moved into package acme and the golang.org/x/net/idna dependency
    dropped (identifier values are used verbatim, consistent with the rest of
    gibcert's issuance path).
